msgid "`Canberra UAV's tracker used during the 2014 OutBack Challenge <http://www.suasnews.com/outback-challenge-2014/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:12
#: e6a032dee8ff4664b3b53658a74b847c
msgid "The *AntennaTracker* Project offers firmware for using a supported flight controller board as an Antenna Tracker. This tracker determines the position of a remote vehicle via its own GPS data and telemetry data from a Copter, Rover, or Plane, and uses this information to align a directional antenna towards the vehicle. Such alignment *significantly* enhances the transmission and reception range from a ground station."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:15
#: 196826fe2bd1405db5fcdb64509127ca
msgid "This tracker design does NOT require the use of a ground control station. Design using the vehicles location as reported by the GCS is detailed :ref:`here <common-mission-planner-gps-based-antenna-tracking>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:17
#: b7b06c5d55d94351aa11edb81468c8f0
msgid "Developers interested in AntennaTracker are invited to join the ArduPilot Discord channel accessible in the Community menu. Users seeking AntennaTracker support should refer to the support forums under the same menu. This manual serves as a guide for setup and configuration."
msgstr ""

